$DATUM 8-(3-(4-Morpholin-4yl-phenyl)-5-phenylpyridin-4-yl)-2,8-diazaspiro[4.5]decan-1-one
(63) To a suspension of
8-(3-chloro-5-(4-morpholinophenyl)pyridin-4-yl)-2,8-diazaspiro[4.5]decan-1-
one 44 (50 mg, 0.12 mmol),
4,4,5,5-tetramethyl-2-phenyl-1,3,2-dioxaborolane (27 mg, 0.18 mmol) and
sodium carbonate (31 mg, 0.29 mmol) in acetonitrile (2.0 mL) and water
(0.5 mL) was added dichlorobis(tricyclohexylphosphine)palladium(II) (4.3
mg, 6.0 mmol). The mixture was heated in a microwave reactor at 150 °C
for 45 min and concentrated. The crude product was purified by
preparative HPLC (acetonitrile/ water, gradient). The TFA salt of the
title compound 63 as a white solid (56.9 mg, 83% yield). 1H NMR (500 MHz,
DMSO-d6) δ 0.96 (dt, J = 13.4, 3.4 Hz, 2H), 1.36 (ddd, J = 13.1, 11.1,
4.2 Hz, 2H), 1.71 (t, J = 6.8 Hz, 2H), 2.59 (ddd, J = 13.7, 11.3, 3.1 Hz,
2H), 2.93-3.09 (m, 4H), 3.13-3.26 (m, 5H), 3.68-3.82 (m, 4H), 7.08 (d, J
= 8.8 Hz, 2H), 7.34 (d, J = 8.7 Hz, 2H), 7.41-7.63 (m, 6H), 8.28 (d, J =
4.4 Hz, 2H); LC (Method G) - MS (ESI, m/z) Rt = 2.06 min – 469 (M+H)+.
ESI-HRMS: Found: 469.2570 calculated for C29H33N4O2 (M+H)+: 469.2598.
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):NOTES
$DATUM microwave irradiation (stage 1), thermal (stage 1), prep HPLC stage 2,
Suzuki coupling (stage 1)
